    registry over boardctl's own board + warpfs's board (529 tasks). Census,
    --json, --list, --validate, --strict all as documented; read-only held.
    
    Findings filed on the board (DF-BOARDCTL-34..37, via boardctl create):
    - 34 (P1) umbrella --stats tallies warpfs's embedded-JSON priority verbatim
      into grand-total buckets (umbrella.go Stats() has no vocabulary gate)
    - 35 (P2) doctor's tracked-set check misses UNTRACKED board.db fossils in
      the board dir (untracked 12KB DuckDB regenerating here, mtime today)
    - 36 (P2) warpfs's board is a second dialect (597 warnings) — cross-repo
      views need an onboarding/remediation recipe
    - 37 (P2) umbrella --list takes no --status
    
